{"pin":"BH01089","subcodes":[{"code":"BH01089","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise be to God Who hath sent down the verses, made manifest the clear tokens, and caused the Supreme Pen to speak forth betwixt earth and heaven [3.5s]... ...You should exhort all the friends to patience, to acquiescence, and to tranquility, saying: O ye loved ones of God in that land!","first_line_orig":"الحمد لله الذی انزل الایات و اظهر البینات و انطق القلم الاعلی بین الارض و  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"760","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA28:436","source":"INBA28","locator":"436","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v028/?page=229"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AYI2.228x","source":"AYI2","locator":"228x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AI2/ai2-214.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AYI2.229x","source":"AYI2","locator":"229x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AI2/ai2-215.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#786","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"786","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/274071354"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NANU_BH#09x","source":"NANU_BH","locator":"09x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/236802375"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_FIRE_BH#05x","source":"BRL_FIRE_BH","locator":"05x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/121495502"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#0334x","source":"COC","locator":"0334x"}]},{"code":"BH01089ACQ","anchor":"acq","translations":[{"language":"mi","lang_name":"Maori"}]}]}
